      "description": "A man in a plaid shirt is pointing his right index finger to the right side of the frame with a dismissive and frustrated facial expression. He is standing in front of a red backdrop with event logos. The scene conveys a confrontational or defensive attitude, amplified by his gesture and the overlaid text expressing frustration about being reported for memes.",
