      "description": "The target community is internet meme creators who experience frequent content reporting on social media platforms. The meme uses the visual of Quentin Tarantino pointing aggressively to represent the frustrated creator defending their work, with the text expressing self-referential humor about being unfairly flagged for memes. The audience is familiar with internet meme culture and the frustrations of content moderation.",
